      "text": "give to the poor, Mark 10:21. love ye your enemies, Luke 6:35. brought him to an inn, and took care of him, Luke 10:34. give alms of such things as ye have, Luke 11:41. charity edifieth, 1 Cor. 8:1. Charity suffereth long, and is kind, 1 Cor. 13:4 (Moro. 7:43–48). now abideth faith, hope, charity, 1 Cor. 13:13 (Alma 7:24; D&C 4:5; 18:19). Let all your things be done with charity, 1 Cor. 16:14. above all these things put on charity, Col. 3:14. end of the commandment is charity out of a pure heart, 1 Tim. 1:5. Pure religion and undefiled … To visit the fatherless, James 1:27. charity shall cover the multitude of sins, 1 Pet. 4:8. to brotherly kindness charity, 2 Pet. 1:7.",
